OL,3,AArticle: published on 17 November 2026
OL,4,
OL,5,FA US Army officer arrested in the UK on
OL,6,Fsuspicion of spying for Russia earlier
OL,7,Fthis month has been taken into US
OL,8,Fmilitary custody, British
OL,9,Fcounter-terror police have said.
OL,11,FThe serviceman has been identified as
OL,12,FLt Col Brandon Carroll Tyner, BBC News
OL,13,Funderstands. The 41-year-old - who
OL,14,Fserved in the US Army since 2008 - was
OL,15,Farrested near Gloucester last week by
OL,16,FBritish counter-terror police.
OL,18,FTyner was based at Imjin Barracks in
OL,19,FInnsworth, Gloucestershire, the
OL,20,Fheadquarters of Nato's Allied Rapid
OL,21,FReaction Corps.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
