OL,4,
OL,5,FCounter Terrorism Policing said he is
OL,6,Fnow in US custody over suspected
OL,7,Fnational security and espionage
OL,8,Fallegations. At the time of his arrest,
OL,9,FRussia said it had "nothing to do with
OL,10,Fit".
